    "title": "[v17.0/forgejo] forgery: allow setting options when creating an organization",
    "body": "**Backport:** #15233\r\n\r\nCurrently, no options can be set when creating an organization in\r\nforgery. To allow this, add another organization creation function that\r\naccepts options. Only visibility is supported as option for now.\r\n\r\nThis will be used by forgejo/forgejo!15145.\r\n\r\nThis is a separate PR to make backporting easier (see https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/15145#issuecomment-27343296).\r\n\r\n- [x] I confirm that I make this contribution in accordance with [Forgejo's AI Agreement](https://codeberg.org/forgejo/governance/src/commit/9084720dc6a7fbf1d3f358919d46bd6adfb55287/AIAgreement.md).\r\n\r\n(cherry picked from commit 4d2648a1baf8d38ec530a330c4fe7e5026bee779)\r\n\r\nReviewed-on: https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/15233\r\nReviewed-by: Antonin Delpeuch \u003cwetneb@noreply.codeberg.org\u003e\r\nReviewed-by: oliverpool \u003coliverpool@noreply.codeberg.org\u003e\r\nReviewed-by: Mathieu Fenniak \u003cmathieu@fenniak.net\u003e\r\n\r\n",
